## 八、综合实例：个人银行账户管理程序（第 5 章版）

第 4 章的 Account 只管单个对象；本讲给它装上「银行级家底」：静态成员统计开户总数与总余额，常成员函数承担只读操作，友元函数直接读私有数据出报表（demo05g，实跑）。

```cpp
class Account {
    friend void printBankReport(const Account &a);   // 友元报表函数
public:
    Account(const string &owner, double balance)
        : owner(owner), balance(balance) {
        count++;                          // 静态成员记账：每开户 +1
        totalBalance += balance;
    }
    ~Account() {
        count--;
        totalBalance -= balance;
    }
    void deposit(double amt) {
        balance += amt;
        totalBalance += amt;
    }
    bool withdraw(double amt) {
        if (amt > balance) return false;
        balance -= amt;
        totalBalance -= amt;
        return true;
    }
    // 常成员函数：只读操作全部 const
    string getOwner() const { return owner; }
    double getBalance() const { return balance; }
    static int getCount() { return count; }
    static double getTotalBalance() { return totalBalance; }
private:
    string owner;
    double balance;
    static int count;                     // 类内声明
    static double totalBalance;
};

// 类外定义并初始化（5.3 的铁律）
int Account::count = 0;
double Account::totalBalance = 0.0;

// 友元函数：不绕 getXXX 接口，直接读私有成员做报表
void printBankReport(const Account &a) {
    cout << "  [" << a.owner << "]  balance = "
         << fixed << setprecision(2) << a.balance << endl;
}

int main() {
    cout << "=== Bank open ===" << endl;
    cout << "accounts = " << Account::getCount()
         << ", total = " << Account::getTotalBalance() << endl << endl;
    Account a("Alice", 1000.0);
    Account b("Bob", 500.0);
    Account c("Carol", 2000.0);
    cout << "after 3 open: accounts = " << Account::getCount()
         << ", total = " << Account::getTotalBalance() << endl << endl;
    a.deposit(300.0);
    b.withdraw(100.0);
    cout << "a.deposit(300), b.withdraw(100):" << endl;
    cout << "total = " << Account::getTotalBalance() << endl << endl;
    cout << "b.withdraw(9999) -> "
         << (b.withdraw(9999.0) ? "ok" : "rejected") << endl << endl;
    cout << "=== Report (via friend function) ===" << endl;
    printBankReport(a);
    printBankReport(b);
    printBankReport(c);
    cout << "=== Bank report done, accounts = "
         << Account::getCount() << " ===" << endl;
    return 0;
}
```

真实输出：

```text
=== Bank open ===
accounts = 0, total = 0

after 3 open: accounts = 3, total = 3500

a.deposit(300), b.withdraw(100):
total = 3700

b.withdraw(9999) -> rejected

=== Report (via friend function) ===
  [Alice]  balance = 1300.00
  [Bob]  balance = 400.00
  [Carol]  balance = 2000.00
=== Bank report done, accounts = 3 ===
```

本讲三件武器各就各位：

- **静态成员**：总余额 3700 = 3500 + 300 − 100，B 的取款同时反映在类级账本上；超额取款被拒后总额不动。
- **常成员函数**：getOwner / getBalance / 静态读函数全部 const，报表与查询随便调。
- **友元函数**：printBankReport 直接读 `a.owner`，省掉一组仅为报表服务的公有接口 —— 数据多一个公有出口，就多一分被滥用的风险。


:::callout note open 为什么第 8 章还会回来改这个类
现在的 Account 用 `bool withdraw()` 返回成功失败；第 8 章会加虚函数支持不同账户类型（ SavingsAccount / CreditAccount ），第 12 章把 rejected 改成 throw。每一章都在给同一个类加能力 —— 这就是教材贯穿案例的意义。
:::
